  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2a245334-05a7-585d-8da0-d4c533e3afba" activityNameId="0990c827-6f04-5d29-8d5c-a9bd41dafa64" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Barley grains conventional, Barrois, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Barley grains conventional, Barrois, at farm
Inventory refers to production of 1 kg barley grains conventional, Barrois, at farm (14% moisture content). Yield at 14% moisture: 6760 kg/ha.;
UUID: a5ffacd6-84f3-3095-9d2f-d0b2858b49a3
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control, harvest and drying of the grains. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the farm are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included. The system boundary is at the farm gate.
Location: Refers to an average production in the region Barrois (FR).
Technology: conventional production typical for the region
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 2000-2004.
Production volume: 11026000t in 2004.
Sampling: Data come from a survey in the concerted action GL-Pro of the EU (QLK5-CT-2002-02418). Data were compiled from statistics, pilot networks, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts in GL-Pro and by other experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a5ffacd6-84f3-3095-9d2f-d0b2858b49a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
